  "notes": "READING NOTE:\nAlso written and read as {種々|くさぐさ} in more literary contexts.\n\nUSAGE:\n{種々|しゅじゅ} is more formal and literary than {色々|いろいろ} (various). Often used in written or formal contexts.\n\nCOMPOUNDS:\n- {種々|しゅじゅ}{様々|さまざま} - all sorts of; various and sundry\n- {種々|しゅじゅ}{雑多|ざった} - miscellaneous; sundry\n\nSYNONYMS:\n- {色々|いろいろ} - various (more common, less formal)\n- {様々|さまざま} - various, diverse\n- {諸々|もろもろ} - various, all sorts of (formal)",
